      "rev_n_1_7f88c8_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_7f88c8_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_7f88c8",
        "thought_text": "The BFS approach is correct, but there's an error in the condition for checking opposite parity. The condition should be (a[current] % 2) != (a[next_pos] % 2), but the code uses (a[current] % 2) != (a[next_pos] % 2) instead. Additionally, for positions with the same parity, the code should continue BFS without increasing distance, but it's adding the position to the queue with the same distance.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_7f88c8_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_c728eee783",
        "created_at": 1794527423.3191566
      },
      "rev_n_2_29df4c_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_29df4c_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_29df4c",
        "thought_text": "The current approach using BFS for both odd and even parity is correct, but the issue lies in the initialization of the distances. We need to reset the distances to -1 before starting the BFS for each parity. This ensures that we don't use previously calculated distances from other parities.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_29df4c_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_fa0e8c7b96",
        "created_at": 1794527450.493003
      },
      "rev_n_3_0b3390_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_0b3390_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_0b3390",
        "thought_text": "The current approach initializes the queue with positions having opposite parity from the first element, which can lead to incorrect results. Instead, we should initialize the queue with all positions and perform a BFS from each position, updating the result array as we go. This ensures we find the minimum number of moves for each position to reach a position with opposite parity.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_0b3390_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_813f2f5b6d",
        "created_at": 1794527485.9435937
